# The generator and its inputs are not the site.
# `index.html` plus `shots/` and `favicon.svg` are what gets served; everything
# below is how they are produced, or the variant meant for a host that blocks
# external images. Shipping them would put a 2.4 MB duplicate of the page and a
# build script on a public URL for nothing.
build.sh
build.py
page.src.html
page.html
